    </div>
  </div>

  <main id="main-content" role="main">
    <article class="poster">

      <!-- HERO -->
      <header class="hero">
        <div class="brand-row">
          <div class="brand-mark">
            <div class="brand-logo">U</div>
            <span>unicef · for every child</span>
          </div>
          <div class="tagline-pill">Global Education Campaign</div>
        </div>

        <h1 class="hero-title animate">
          Every Child<br>
          Deserves
          <em>to Learn.</em>
        </h1>
        <p class="hero-subtitle animate delay-1">
          Education is a fundamental right. Yet millions of children are still denied
          the classroom — because of conflict, poverty, discrimination, and climate shocks.
          Together, we can rewrite that future.
        </p>
      </header>

      <!-- ANCHOR STAT -->
      <section class="anchor" aria-labelledby="crisis-heading">
        <div class="anchor-layout">
          <div class="anchor-number animate delay-1" aria-label="250 million children out of school">
            250M
            <span class="unit">children out of school</span>
          </div>
          <div class="anchor-text animate delay-2">
            <span class="section-label">The Scale of the Crisis</span>
            <h3 id="crisis-heading">A quarter of a billion children are locked out of the classroom — today.</h3>
            <p>Even among those who attend, learning outcomes remain dangerously low. This isn't lost potential for a few — it is a setback for entire communities, economies, and generations.</p>

            <div class="mini-stats">
              <div class="mini-stat">
                <div class="num">70%</div>
                <div class="label">of 10-year-olds in low &amp; middle-income countries can't read a simple text</div>
              </div>
              <div class="mini-stat">
                <div class="num">190+</div>
                <div class="label">countries &amp; territories where UNICEF runs education programmes</div>
              </div>
              <div class="mini-stat">
                <div class="num">2.5×</div>
                <div class="label">Girls more likely to be out of school in crisis-affected regions</div>
              </div>
              <div class="mini-stat">
                <div class="num">~49%</div>
                <div class="label">Children with disabilities out of school in low-income countries</div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- BARRIERS -->
      <section class="barriers" aria-labelledby="barriers-heading">
        <span class="section-label">Barriers to Education</span>
        <h2 class="section-title" id="barriers-heading">Real children. Real obstacles.</h2>

        <div class="barriers-grid">
          <div class="barrier">
            <div class="icon" aria-hidden="true">
              <svg width="26" height="26" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                <path d="M12 2 4 7v6c0 5 3.5 8 8 9 4.5-1 8-4 8-9V7l-8-5z"/>
                <path d="M9 12l2 2 4-4"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h4>Armed Conflict</h4>
            <p>Schools destroyed, teachers displaced, children traumatized in war zones.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="barrier">
            <div class="icon" aria-hidden="true">
              <svg width="26" height="26" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/>
                <path d="M12 7v10M9 10h4.5a2 2 0 1 1 0 4H8"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h4>Poverty</h4>
            <p>Families cannot afford fees, uniforms, or supplies — or rely on child labour.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="barrier">
            <div class="icon" aria-hidden="true">
              <svg width="26" height="26" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                <circle cx="12" cy="7" r="4"/>
                <path d="M12 11v10M9 17h6"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h4>Gender Inequality</h4>
            <p>Social norms still limit girls' access, especially at the secondary level.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="barrier">
            <div class="icon" aria-hidden="true">
              <svg width="26" height="26" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                <circle cx="12" cy="5" r="2"/>
                <path d="M10 22v-5l-3-3 3-4h4l3 4-2 2"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h4>Disability</h4>
            <p>Nearly half of children with disabilities in low-income countries never reach a classroom.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="barrier">
            <div class="icon" aria-hidden="true">
              <svg width="26" height="26" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                <path d="M17 10a5 5 0 0 0-9.58-1.8A4 4 0 0 0 6 16h11a4 4 0 0 0 0-6z"/>
                <path d="M8 20l-1 2M12 20l-1 2M16 20l-1 2"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h4>Climate Shocks</h4>
            <p>Floods, droughts, and extreme weather disrupt schooling for the most vulnerable.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- PILLARS -->
      <section class="pillars" aria-labelledby="focus-heading">
        <div class="pillars-head">
          <div>
            <span class="section-label">UNICEF Focus Areas</span>
            <h2 class="section-title" id="focus-heading">Six pillars. One promise.</h2>
          </div>
          <p>A coordinated strategy to reach every child — from their earliest years through adolescence, in classrooms and in crisis.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="pillars-grid">
          <div class="pillar">
            <div class="num">01</div>
            <div>
              <h4>Early Childhood Development</h4>
              <p>Strong foundations through pre-primary education and school readiness.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="pillar">
            <div class="num">02</div>
            <div>
              <h4>Inclusive Education</h4>
              <p>Ensuring children with disabilities and marginalized groups can thrive.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="pillar">
            <div class="num">03</div>
            <div>
              <h4>Gender Equality</h4>
              <p>Removing barriers so girls enrol, stay, and complete their schooling.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="pillar">
            <div class="num">04</div>
            <div>
              <h4>Education in Emergencies</h4>
              <p>Learning continuity for children affected by conflict and disaster.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="pillar">
            <div class="num">05</div>
            <div>
              <h4>Digital &amp; Innovative Learning</h4>
              <p>Leveraging technology to expand access and improve quality.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="pillar">
            <div class="num">06</div>
            <div>
              <h4>Adolescent Skills</h4>
              <p>Equipping young people for employment, civic life, and lifelong learning.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- CTA -->
      <section class="cta" aria-labelledby="cta-heading">
        <div class="cta-grid">
          <div>
            <span class="section-label" style="color:#2A1800;">What You Can Do</span>
            <h2 id="cta-heading">No child left behind isn't a slogan — it's a choice we make together.</h2>
            <p>Every child who misses school is a missed opportunity for a healthier, more equitable, more prosperous world. Invest in education — invest in peace, innovation, and sustainable development.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="cta-actions">
            <div class="cta-action">
              <div class="dot" aria-hidden="true">
                <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20.8 4.6a5.5 5.5 0 0 0-7.8 0L12 5.6l-1-1a5.5 5.5 0 1 0-7.8 7.8l8.8 8.8 8.8-8.8a5.5 5.5 0 0 0 0-7.8z"/></svg>
              </div>
              <div class="txt">Donate to UNICEF Education<span>Fund classrooms, teachers &amp; learning materials</span></div>
            </div>
            <div class="cta-action">
              <div class="dot" aria-hidden="true">
                <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M3 21v-2a4 4 0 0 1 4-4h10a4 4 0 0 1 4 4v2"/><circle cx="12" cy="7" r="4"/></svg>
              </div>
              <div class="txt">Advocate in Your Community<span>Push governments to uphold SDG 4</span></div>
            </div>
            <div class="cta-action">
              <div class="dot" aria-hidden="true">
                <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M4 4h16v12H5.5L4 17.5z"/></svg>
              </div>
              <div class="txt">Share This Message<span>Break the silence around the learning crisis</span></div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- FOOTER -->
      <footer class="footer">
        <div class="footer-left">
          <div class="badge">SDG 4</div>
          <span>Quality Education for Every Child · Aligned with the United Nations Sustainable Development Goals</span>
        </div>
        <div class="footer-right">unicef.org/education</div>
      </footer>

    </article>
  </main>

  <script>
